// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — 會考單字搭配詞 轉折詞 Transition Words (tools/jphrase_emit.py)
window.JTW_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"additionally – previously","cards":[{"w":"additionally","p":"adv.","d":"used to add another point","c":"此外（補充）","s":"Our school library has many new storybooks this year. _____, it now has six computers that students can use after class."},{"w":"again","p":"adv.","d":"used to add one more point to what you said","c":"再者；另外（補充）","s":"Walking to school is good for your health because you move your body every day. _____, it saves your parents time and gas money."},{"w":"also","p":"adv.","d":"used to add another fact or idea","c":"也；而且（補充）","s":"My cousin is very good at drawing pictures of animals. She _____ plays the guitar in the school band every Friday afternoon."},{"w":"another + N","p":"adj.","d":"used to add one more thing of the same kind","c":"另一個（補充）","s":"One reason I like summer is the long vacation. _____ reason is that I can swim in the pool with my friends every day."},{"w":"as well as + N","p":"conj.phr.","d":"used to add another thing; means 'and also'","c":"以及；還有（補充）","s":"Lily practices the piano every evening after dinner. She can play the violin _____ _____ _____ the piano, so she joined two music clubs."},{"w":"besides","p":"adv.","d":"used to add another reason or point","c":"此外；而且（補充）","s":"I don't want to go to the night market tonight because I am too tired. _____, I still have a lot of homework to finish."},{"w":"coupled with + N","p":"prep.phr.","d":"used to add something that happens together with another thing","c":"加上；連同（補充）（正式用語）","s":"Tom stayed up late playing games every night. This, _____ _____ a bad breakfast, made him feel sleepy in class."},{"w":"further","p":"adv.","d":"used to add one more point, often in writing","c":"此外；再者（補充）（正式用語）","s":"Riding a bike to school is cheaper than taking the bus. _____, it is good for the earth because bikes do not make dirty air."},{"w":"furthermore","p":"adv.","d":"used to add another important point","c":"此外；而且（補充）（正式用語）","s":"Our new teacher explains grammar in a clear and easy way. _____, she always gives us fun games to practice new words."},{"w":"equally important","p":"adj.phr.","d":"used to add a point that is just as important as the last one","c":"同樣重要的是（補充）","s":"Eating healthy food is important for growing students. _____ _____, you should sleep at least eight hours every night."},{"w":"in addition","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to add more information","c":"此外；另外（補充）","s":"Our new classroom has bigger windows and brighter lights. _____ _____, it has an air conditioner and a new projector."},{"w":"likewise","p":"adv.","d":"used to add a point that is the same or similar","c":"同樣地（補充）","s":"You should say thank you when someone helps you at school. _____, you should say sorry when you make a mistake."},{"w":"moreover","p":"adv.","d":"used to add a stronger or more important point","c":"此外；而且（補充）（正式用語）","s":"This small cafe near our school sells cheap and tasty sandwiches. _____, the owner is very kind and always remembers our names."},{"w":"accordingly","p":"adv.","d":"used to show a result that matches the situation","c":"因此；於是（結果）（正式用語）","s":"The weather report said a typhoon was coming on Friday. _____, our school canceled the sports day and moved it to next week."},{"w":"after + N/子句","p":"conj.","d":"used to show that one thing happens first and the next thing follows","c":"在……之後（時間順序）","s":"Amy always feels tired when she gets home. _____ she finishes her homework, she takes a hot shower and goes to bed."},{"w":"as a consequence","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show a result, often a bad one","c":"結果；因此（結果）（正式用語）","s":"Jack forgot to set his alarm clock last night. _____ _____ _____, he missed the school bus and was late for class."},{"w":"as a result","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show the result of something","c":"結果；因此（結果）","s":"Mary studied English for one hour every day this semester. _____ _____ _____, she got the highest score on the final exam."},{"w":"at that time","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to talk about what was happening at a certain time in the past","c":"當時；那時候（時間）","s":"My parents moved to Taipei ten years ago. _____ _____ _____, there was no MRT station near our home, so they rode a scooter to work."},{"w":"before + N/子句","p":"conj.","d":"used to show that one thing happens earlier than another","c":"在……之前（時間順序）","s":"Mom has a rule in our house about dinner. _____ we eat dinner, we must wash our hands and set the table together."},{"w":"concurrently","p":"adv.","d":"used to show that two things happen at the same time","c":"同時（時間）（正式用語）","s":"Ben was cooking noodles for the family in the kitchen. _____, his little sister was cleaning the table in the living room."},{"w":"consequently","p":"adv.","d":"used to show the result of an action","c":"因此；結果（結果）（正式用語）","s":"Kevin ate too much ice cream at the party last night. _____, he had a stomachache and could not come to school today."},{"w":"finally","p":"adv.","d":"used to introduce the last step or the end result","c":"最後；終於（順序／結果）","s":"We waited for the bus in the rain for forty minutes. _____, it came, and we all got on quickly."},{"w":"followed by + N","p":"prep.phr.","d":"used to show what comes next in order","c":"接著是；隨後是（時間順序）","s":"Our school concert started with a song from the choir. It was _____ _____ a short play by the ninth graders."},{"w":"for this purpose","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show the reason or goal for an action","c":"為了這個目的（目的）","s":"Our class wants to clean the beach next Saturday morning. _____ _____ _____, everyone will bring trash bags and gloves."},{"w":"for this reason","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show the reason for the next action","c":"因為這個原因；因此（原因）","s":"My little brother is afraid of big dogs. _____ _____ _____, we never walk past the house with the black dog."},{"w":"hence","p":"adv.","d":"used to show a result, often in writing","c":"因此（結果）（正式用語）","s":"Our school is very far from the MRT station and there are few buses. _____, many students ride bikes to school."},{"w":"initially","p":"adv.","d":"used to talk about the beginning, before things changed","c":"起初；一開始（時間順序）（正式用語）","s":"_____, I did not like living in the new town because I had no friends. Now I love it and have many classmates to play with."},{"w":"next","p":"adv.","d":"used to show the following step","c":"接下來；然後（順序）","s":"To make a cup of milk tea, first put a tea bag in hot water. _____, add some milk and a little sugar."},{"w":"otherwise","p":"adv.","d":"used to show what will happen if you do not do something","c":"否則；不然（結果）","s":"You should bring an umbrella with you today. _____, you will get wet on the way home because it will rain this afternoon."},{"w":"previously","p":"adv.","d":"used to talk about something that happened before now","c":"先前；以前（時間）（正式用語）","s":"Mr. Lin teaches math at our school now. _____, he worked as an engineer at a computer company in Hsinchu."}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"so then – even so","cards":[{"w":"so then","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show what happened because of the last thing","c":"所以接著；於是（結果）","s":"It suddenly started to rain hard during our basketball game. _____ _____, we stopped playing and ran into the classroom."},{"w":"subsequently","p":"adv.","d":"used to show what happened later, after something else","c":"隨後；後來（時間順序）（正式用語）","s":"Sam hurt his leg while playing soccer last month. _____, he could not join the school race, so he cheered for his team."},{"w":"then","p":"adv.","d":"used to show the next thing that happens","c":"然後；接著（順序）","s":"On Sunday morning, my family went to the park for a walk. _____ we had beef noodles at a small shop nearby."},{"w":"therefore","p":"adv.","d":"used to show a result or conclusion","c":"因此；所以（結果）","s":"The museum is closed on Mondays for cleaning. _____, we will visit it on Tuesday morning with our teacher instead."},{"w":"thus","p":"adv.","d":"used to show a result, often in writing","c":"因此（結果）（正式用語）","s":"Anna practiced speaking English with her friends every day. _____, she was not nervous at all in the speech contest."},{"w":"as well as + N","p":"conj.phr.","d":"used to show that two people or things are the same in some way","c":"和……一樣；以及（比較）","s":"Both of my parents love sports very much. My mother, _____ _____ _____ my father, runs in the park every morning."},{"w":"comparatively","p":"adv.","d":"used to say something is more or less true when compared with others","c":"相對地；比較起來（比較）（正式用語）","s":"Most of my classmates live far away and take the bus to school. My home is _____ close, so I can walk there in five minutes."},{"w":"conversely","p":"adv.","d":"used to show the opposite side of a comparison","c":"相反地（比較／對比）（正式用語）","s":"Some students like to study early in the morning when it is quiet. _____, others study better late at night."},{"w":"correspondingly","p":"adv.","d":"used to show that one thing changes in the same way as another","c":"相應地；同樣地（比較）（正式用語）","s":"The number of students at our school grew a lot this year. _____, the school hired more teachers and opened two new classrooms."},{"w":"coupled with + N","p":"prep.phr.","d":"used to put two similar things together","c":"加上；連同（比較）（正式用語）","s":"Good sleep helps students remember what they learn. Healthy food, _____ _____ exercise, also helps them do well at school."},{"w":"in the same way","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show that two things are similar","c":"同樣地（比較）","s":"Plants need water and sunlight to grow tall and strong. _____ _____ _____ _____, children need good food and love to grow well."},{"w":"likewise","p":"adv.","d":"used to show that something is the same as the thing before","c":"同樣地（比較）","s":"My father always reads the newspaper with his coffee in the morning. _____, my grandfather reads a book with his tea."},{"w":"moreover","p":"adv.","d":"used to add a similar but stronger point","c":"此外；而且（比較／補充）（正式用語）","s":"This new phone is lighter than my old one. _____, its camera is much better, so my photos look clearer."},{"w":"on the one hand","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give the first side of a comparison (often with 'on the other hand')","c":"一方面（比較）","s":"_____ _____ _____ _____, living in a big city is very convenient. On the other hand, it is often noisy and crowded."},{"w":"similar","p":"adj.","d":"used to say two things are almost the same","c":"相似的（比較）","s":"Tom's school bag and my school bag are very _____. They are both blue and have a cartoon cat on the front."},{"w":"similar to + N","p":"adj.phr.","d":"used to say one thing is almost the same as another","c":"和……相似（比較）","s":"My new phone is _____ _____ my old one. They are both black and small, and they have the same games."},{"w":"similarly","p":"adv.","d":"used to show that two things are alike","c":"同樣地；相似地（比較）","s":"Cats like to sleep in warm and quiet places during the day. _____, dogs often look for a soft bed to take a nap."},{"w":"together with + N","p":"prep.phr.","d":"used to show people or things that are joined or the same","c":"連同；和……一起（比較）","s":"My best friend Kelly enjoys drawing in her free time. She, _____ _____ her twin sister, won first prize in the art contest."},{"w":"whereas + 子句","p":"conj.","d":"used to compare two different facts","c":"然而；而（對比）（正式用語）","s":"My brother loves to play basketball outside on weekends, _____ I prefer to stay at home and read comic books."},{"w":"while + 子句","p":"conj.","d":"used to show two things happening in a similar way at the same time","c":"而；同時（比較）","s":"My sister practices the piano in the living room every evening, _____ I practice the violin in my room at the same time."},{"w":"a different view is","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to introduce an opposite opinion","c":"另一種看法是（對比）","s":"Many students think that homework helps them learn better. _____ _____ _____ _____ that too much homework makes students tired and unhappy."},{"w":"admittedly","p":"adv.","d":"used to agree that something bad or different is true","c":"不可否認地（讓步）","s":"Our class trip to the zoo was a lot of fun. _____, it rained in the morning, but the sun came out after lunch."},{"w":"albeit","p":"conj.","d":"used to add a small point that makes the first part less strong","c":"雖然；儘管（讓步）（正式用語）","s":"After many hard weeks, Tom finally finished his science report, _____ two days after the teacher's deadline."},{"w":"alternatively","p":"adv.","d":"used to give another choice","c":"或者；另一個選擇是（替代）","s":"We can take the MRT to the museum on Saturday. _____, we can ride our bikes there if the weather is nice."},{"w":"although + 子句","p":"conj.","d":"used to show that the second part is surprising after the first part","c":"雖然（讓步）","s":"_____ Amy was very tired after school, she still finished all her homework before dinner."},{"w":"and yet","p":"conj.phr.","d":"used to add a surprising or opposite idea","c":"然而；卻（對比）","s":"Ben studied for the English test for only one hour, _____ _____ he got the highest score in the class."},{"w":"conversely","p":"adv.","d":"used to show the opposite situation","c":"相反地（對比）（正式用語）","s":"In summer, many people in Taiwan buy cold drinks and ice cream. _____, in winter, they buy more hot soup and hot tea."},{"w":"despite / in spite of + N/V-ing","p":"prep. / prep.phr.","d":"used to show that something happens even with a problem","c":"儘管；雖然（讓步）","s":"_____ the heavy rain, all the students still played soccer on the school field after class."},{"w":"differing from + N","p":"prep.phr.","d":"used to show how one person or thing is not the same as another","c":"與……不同（對比）","s":"Most students in my class take the bus to school. _____ _____ them, Lily walks to school every day because she lives near it."},{"w":"even so","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show a surprising result after a problem","c":"即使如此（讓步）","s":"The math test was very difficult, and many students did not finish it. _____ _____, Jack got a good score."}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"even though + 子句 – illustrated by + N","cards":[{"w":"even though + 子句","p":"conj.phr.","d":"used to show that something happens even with a problem","c":"即使；雖然（讓步）","s":"_____ _____ it was very cold this morning, my little brother did not want to wear his jacket to school."},{"w":"granted","p":"adv.","d":"used to agree that a point is true before giving a different idea","c":"誠然；就算如此（讓步）","s":"My dad wants to buy the new phone because it has a great camera. _____, it is very expensive, but he thinks it is worth the money."},{"w":"however","p":"adv.","d":"used to show a different or opposite idea","c":"然而（對比）","s":"Mia wanted to go to the night market with her friends on Friday. _____, her mom said she had to stay home and study."},{"w":"in contrast","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show that two things are very different","c":"相比之下；對照之下（對比）","s":"My sister's room is always clean and tidy. _____ _____, my room is full of books, clothes, and toys on the floor."},{"w":"instead","p":"adv.","d":"used to show what happens in place of another thing","c":"反而；取而代之（替代）","s":"We planned to have a picnic in the park on Sunday, but it rained all day. _____, we stayed home and watched a movie together."},{"w":"it could also be said that","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give another way to look at an idea","c":"也可以說（對比）","s":"Many people say that cell phones are bad for students. _____ _____ _____ _____ _____ _____ cell phones help students find information quickly."},{"w":"nevertheless","p":"adv.","d":"used to show that something still happens after a problem","c":"儘管如此；然而（讓步）（正式用語）","s":"The mountain path was long and steep. _____, all the students kept walking and reached the top before noon."},{"w":"notwithstanding + N","p":"prep.","d":"used to show that something happens even with a problem","c":"儘管（讓步）（正式用語）","s":"_____ the long bus ride, all the students enjoyed their school trip to Kenting very much."},{"w":"nonetheless","p":"adv.","d":"used to show that something still happens after a problem","c":"儘管如此（讓步）（正式用語）","s":"Grandpa is eighty years old and has a bad leg. _____, he takes a walk in the park every morning."},{"w":"on the contrary","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to say the opposite is true","c":"正好相反（對比）","s":"My brother is not lazy at all. _____ _____ _____, he gets up at six every morning to clean the house and walk the dog."},{"w":"on the one hand","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give the first side of an idea","c":"一方面（對比）","s":"_____ _____ _____ _____, living in a big city is convenient because there are many stores and MRT stations. On the other hand, it is often noisy and crowded."},{"w":"on the other hand","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give the other side of an idea","c":"另一方面（對比）","s":"Living in the countryside is quiet, and the air is fresh. _____ _____ _____ _____, there are not many stores, and the buses do not come often."},{"w":"otherwise","p":"adv.","d":"used to show what will happen if you do not do something","c":"否則；不然（條件對比）","s":"You should bring an umbrella to school today. _____, you will get wet when it rains this afternoon."},{"w":"rather","p":"adv.","d":"used to give the true or opposite idea after a negative","c":"反而；而是（對比）","s":"Lisa did not feel sad when she lost the game. _____, she felt happy because she had tried her best."},{"w":"regardless of + N","p":"prep.phr.","d":"used to show that something does not change a plan or action","c":"不管；不論（讓步）","s":"Our basketball team practices every afternoon. We practice outside _____ _____ the weather, even on very hot or rainy days."},{"w":"still","p":"adv.","d":"used to show that something continues after a problem","c":"仍然；還是（讓步）","s":"The math problem was very hard, and I asked my teacher for help twice. I _____ could not find the right answer."},{"w":"unlike + N","p":"prep.","d":"used to show that two people or things are different","c":"不像；與……不同（對比）","s":"_____ his older brother, who loves sports, Kevin likes to stay home and read books or draw pictures."},{"w":"whereas + 子句","p":"conj.","d":"used to compare two different facts","c":"然而；而（對比）（正式用語）","s":"My father likes to drink hot coffee every morning, _____ my mother always drinks a glass of cold milk."},{"w":"above all","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show the most important point","c":"最重要的是（強調）","s":"A good student should be kind and work hard. _____ _____, he or she should always be honest with teachers and friends."},{"w":"especially","p":"adv.","d":"used to point out one thing more than others","c":"尤其；特別（強調）","s":"My family loves all kinds of fruit in summer. My little brother _____ likes watermelon, and he eats it every day."},{"w":"in fact","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to add a stronger, true point","c":"事實上（強調）","s":"Jenny is not just good at math. _____ _____, she got the highest score in our whole school last month."},{"w":"in particular","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to point out one special person or thing","c":"尤其；特別是（強調）","s":"Everyone in my class enjoyed the school trip to the zoo. Amy, _____ _____, loved watching the pandas eat bamboo for an hour."},{"w":"indeed","p":"adv.","d":"used to say that something is really true","c":"確實；的確（強調）（正式用語）","s":"The teacher said the test would be hard. It was _____ very difficult, and many students could not finish it on time."},{"w":"particularly","p":"adv.","d":"used to point out one thing more than others","c":"特別；尤其（強調）","s":"I like all of my classes this year. I am _____ interested in science because we do fun experiments every week."},{"w":"as an example","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give an example","c":"舉例來說（舉例）","s":"There are many ways to save water at home. _____ _____ _____, you can turn off the tap while you brush your teeth."},{"w":"as an illustration","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give an example that shows an idea","c":"舉例說明（舉例）（正式用語）","s":"Exercise can help you feel happier. _____ _____ _____, my father always smiles more after he goes jogging in the park."},{"w":"chiefly","p":"adv.","d":"used to show the main example or reason","c":"主要地（舉例／說明重點）（正式用語）","s":"Students in our reading club read many kinds of books. They _____ read comic books and short stories, but sometimes they read science books too."},{"w":"for example","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give an example","c":"例如；舉例來說（舉例）","s":"Taipei has many great places to visit. _____ _____, you can go to Taipei 101 or walk around the night markets."},{"w":"for instance","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give an example","c":"例如（舉例）","s":"Some animals sleep during the day. _____ _____, owls sleep in the daytime and look for food at night."},{"w":"illustrated by + N","p":"prep.phr.","d":"used to show an idea with an example","c":"以…為例說明（舉例）（正式用語）","s":"Kindness can change someone's day, as _____ _____ the way Tom helped a lost little girl find her mother at the station."}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"in particular – to put it differently","cards":[{"w":"in particular","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give one special example","c":"尤其是；特別是（舉例）","s":"Many fruits are good for your health. Oranges, _____ _____, have a lot of vitamin C and can help you stay healthy."},{"w":"in the/this case","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to talk about one situation or example","c":"在這種情況下（舉例／說明情況）","s":"Sometimes it rains heavily during PE class. _____ _____ _____, the students play table tennis in the gym instead of running outside."},{"w":"including + N","p":"prep.","d":"used to give examples that are part of a group","c":"包括（舉例）","s":"Mom bought a lot of food for the birthday party, _____ cake, fried chicken, and three big bottles of juice."},{"w":"markedly","p":"adv.","d":"used to show a big and clear change","c":"明顯地（說明程度）（正式用語）","s":"Lily practiced speaking English every night for three months. Her speaking became _____ better, and her teacher was very surprised."},{"w":"namely","p":"adv.","d":"used to name the exact people or things","c":"也就是；即（舉例說明）（正式用語）","s":"Two students from our class won prizes in the English speech contest, _____ Kevin and Mary."},{"w":"notably","p":"adv.","d":"used to point out an important example","c":"尤其是；特別是（舉例）（正式用語）","s":"Many important guests came to our school's birthday party, _____ the mayor of Taipei, who gave a short speech."},{"w":"on this occasion","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to talk about one special time","c":"這一次（舉例說明特定時候）","s":"Dad usually cooks dinner for our family on Sundays. _____ _____ _____, Mom made dinner because Dad was sick in bed."},{"w":"specifically","p":"adv.","d":"used to give more exact details","c":"具體來說（舉例說明）","s":"The teacher asked us to bring something for art class. _____, she wanted us to bring old newspapers and some glue."},{"w":"such as + N","p":"prep.phr.","d":"used to give examples","c":"例如；像是（舉例）","s":"Our school has many after-school clubs, _____ _____ the dance club, the chess club, and the robot club."},{"w":"to demonstrate","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show how something works with an example","c":"為了示範；為了證明（舉例說明）","s":"Our science teacher wanted to show us that air takes up space. _____ _____, she put an empty cup upside down into a bowl of water."},{"w":"to illustrate","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give an example that explains an idea","c":"舉例來說明（舉例）","s":"Small actions can help protect the earth. _____ _____, if every student brings a water bottle, our school can use thousands fewer plastic cups each year."},{"w":"after all","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give an important reason to remember","c":"畢竟（補充說明）","s":"You should not be too angry with your little sister. _____ _____, she is only five years old and did not mean to break your toy."},{"w":"all things considered","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give a final opinion after thinking about everything","c":"整體考量下（總結）","s":"The hotel was small and a little old. _____ _____ _____, we still had a great family trip because the beach was beautiful."},{"w":"at the same time","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to add another side of an idea","c":"同時；但另一方面（補充／延伸）","s":"Playing video games can be fun and relaxing. _____ _____ _____ _____, playing for too long can hurt your eyes and your grades."},{"w":"clearly","p":"adv.","d":"used to show that something is easy to see or understand","c":"顯然（延伸推論）","s":"Ben's face turned red, and he could not look at the teacher. _____, he had forgotten to do his homework again."},{"w":"in brief","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to say something in a few words","c":"簡言之（總結）","s":"The movie was very long, but the story was simple. _____ _____, a brave boy saves his town from a terrible dragon."},{"w":"in essence","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give the most basic or main idea","c":"本質上；基本上（總結重點）（正式用語）","s":"The teacher talked about many rules for the school trip. _____ _____, she wanted us to stay safe and stay with our group."},{"w":"in fact","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give more true information about an idea","c":"事實上（延伸說明）","s":"At first, I thought the new student was shy. _____ _____, she is very friendly and has already made many friends in our class."},{"w":"in other words","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to say the same idea in another way","c":"換句話說（重新說明）","s":"Our teacher said, \"Your homework must be on my desk before eight tomorrow morning.\" _____ _____ _____, we cannot be late with our homework."},{"w":"in short","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give a short summary","c":"總之；簡單來說（總結）","s":"We missed the bus, it started to rain, and I lost my umbrella. _____ _____, it was a really bad morning for me."},{"w":"indeed","p":"adv.","d":"used to show that something said before is really true","c":"確實；的確（延伸證實）（正式用語）","s":"Grandma said the night market would be crowded on Saturday. _____, there were so many people that we could hardly walk."},{"w":"it seems","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to say what looks true from what we see","c":"看來；似乎（延伸推論）","s":"The sky is getting dark, and the wind is very strong. _____ _____ that a big storm is coming to our city tonight."},{"w":"namely","p":"adv.","d":"used to explain exactly what you mean","c":"也就是（進一步說明）（正式用語）","s":"There is one important thing you must remember before every test, _____ to write your name on the answer sheet."},{"w":"naturally","p":"adv.","d":"used to show that something is expected","c":"自然地；理所當然（延伸結果）","s":"Kevin stayed up late playing games the night before the test. _____, he felt very tired and could not focus in class."},{"w":"of course","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show that something is easy to expect","c":"當然（延伸說明）","s":"Tim worked hard on his science project for many weeks. _____ _____, he was very happy when he won first prize."},{"w":"on the whole","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give a general opinion","c":"大體上；整體來說（總結）","s":"There were a few small problems during our class trip. _____ _____ _____, everyone had a good time and wanted to go again."},{"w":"that is","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to explain something more exactly","c":"也就是說（進一步說明）","s":"Please finish your science report before the weekend, _____ _____, by Friday afternoon at the latest."},{"w":"that is to say","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to explain an idea in another way","c":"也就是說（重新說明）（正式用語）","s":"My cousin has been a vegetarian for five years. _____ _____ _____ _____, he does not eat any meat or fish at all."},{"w":"to be sure","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to agree that one point is true before adding another","c":"誠然；的確（讓步延伸）（正式用語）","s":"Many students complain about our school lunch. _____ _____ _____, it is not always delicious, but it is healthy and cheap."},{"w":"to put it differently","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to say the same idea in another way","c":"換個說法（重新說明）","s":"Mr. Lin said, \"Do not judge a book by its cover.\" _____ _____ _____ _____, we should not decide what people are like just by their looks."}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"after – thus","cards":[{"w":"after","p":"conj.","d":"used to show that one thing happens later than another","c":"在…之後（順序）","s":"Mom says we can watch TV for one hour _____ we finish our homework and clean our rooms."},{"w":"at that time","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to talk about a time in the past","c":"那時候（時間順序）","s":"My family lived in a small village in Nantou ten years ago. _____ _____ _____, there was no convenience store near our house."},{"w":"before","p":"conj.","d":"used to show that one thing happens earlier than another","c":"在…之前（順序）","s":"My little brother always brushes his teeth and reads a short story _____ he goes to bed at night."},{"w":"concurrently","p":"adv.","d":"used to show that two things happen at the same time","c":"同時（時間順序）（正式用語）","s":"Mia is taking piano lessons every Saturday morning this year. _____, she is also learning to swim at the sports center."},{"w":"finally","p":"adv.","d":"used to show the last step or event","c":"最後（順序）","s":"First, we cleaned the classroom, and then we put up the posters. _____, we hung colorful balloons for the Christmas party."},{"w":"followed by + N","p":"prep.phr.","d":"used to show what comes next","c":"接著是（順序）","s":"Our school sports day began with a short speech by the principal, _____ _____ a relay race between all the classes."},{"w":"first / second / third","p":"adv.","d":"used to list steps in order","c":"第一／第二／第三（順序）","s":"There are three easy steps to make a cup of tea. _____, boil some water. Second, put a tea bag in a cup. Third, pour in the hot water."},{"w":"initially","p":"adv.","d":"used to talk about the first step or the beginning","c":"起初（順序）","s":"_____, I thought our new math teacher was very strict. Later, I found out that she was really kind and funny."},{"w":"next","p":"adv.","d":"used to show the following step","c":"接著；下一步（順序）","s":"First, wash the rice and put it in the pot. _____, add two cups of water and turn on the rice cooker."},{"w":"previously","p":"adv.","d":"used to talk about something that happened before","c":"先前；以前（順序）","s":"Mr. Lin teaches English at our school now. _____, he worked as a tour guide in Tainan for five years."},{"w":"subsequently","p":"adv.","d":"used to show what happened after something","c":"隨後；後來（順序）（正式用語）","s":"Amy lost her bike near the park on Monday. _____, a kind old man found it and took it to the police station."},{"w":"then","p":"adv.","d":"used to show the next thing that happens","c":"然後（順序）","s":"We finished our homework right after dinner. _____, we watched a funny movie together in the living room."},{"w":"after all","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give a reason that people should remember","c":"畢竟（總結理由）","s":"Don't be too angry with Tom about the broken cup. _____ _____, he is only seven years old."},{"w":"as a result","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show a result","c":"結果；因此（結果）","s":"Jenny studied hard for the English test every night. _____ _____ _____, she got the highest score in her class."},{"w":"briefly","p":"adv.","d":"used to say the main idea in a few words","c":"簡單來說（總結）","s":"Our class trip had good food, fun games, and beautiful views. _____, it was the best day of the school year."},{"w":"by and large","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give a general idea of the whole thing","c":"大體上；整體而言（總結）","s":"Some students were late, and a few forgot their books. _____ _____ _____, the first week of school went well."},{"w":"consequently","p":"adv.","d":"used to show a result","c":"因此；所以（結果）","s":"It rained very heavily all morning. _____, the school sports day was moved to next Friday."},{"w":"finally","p":"adv.","d":"used to give the last point or to end a talk","c":"最後（總結）","s":"We have talked about healthy food, enough sleep, and exercise. _____, remember that a happy mind is also important for good health."},{"w":"hence","p":"adv.","d":"used to show a result","c":"因此（結果）（正式用語）","s":"The school bus broke down on the way to school this morning. _____, many students were late for the first class."},{"w":"in any case","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to say that something is true no matter what happens","c":"無論如何（總結）","s":"I'm not sure if it will rain tomorrow afternoon. _____ _____ _____, you should bring an umbrella just to be safe."},{"w":"in any event","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to say that something is true no matter what happens","c":"無論如何（總結）（正式用語）","s":"We may go to the beach or the zoo on Sunday. _____ _____ _____, we will have a fun day together as a family."},{"w":"in brief","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to say the main idea in a few words","c":"簡言之（總結）","s":"The movie had great music, funny actors, and an exciting story. _____ _____, it was worth the money."},{"w":"in conclusion","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to start the last part or main idea","c":"總之；總而言之（結論）","s":"Reading helps us learn new words, relax, and understand the world. _____ _____, everyone should read for at least twenty minutes every day."},{"w":"in short","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to say the main idea in a few words","c":"簡而言之（總結）","s":"Tim forgot his homework, missed the bus, and lost his wallet. _____ _____, he had a really bad day."},{"w":"in other words","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to say the same idea in another, easier way","c":"換句話說（解釋／總結）","s":"Our teacher said this quiz will not count toward our final grade. _____ _____ _____, we do not need to worry about it too much."},{"w":"in summary","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give a short review of the main points","c":"總結來說（總結）","s":"Exercise makes our bodies strong and helps us sleep better at night. _____ _____, it is good for both our bodies and our minds."},{"w":"on the whole","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give a general opinion about everything","c":"整體而言（總結）","s":"The food at the night market was a little expensive. _____ _____ _____, we enjoyed our evening there very much."},{"w":"overall","p":"adv.","d":"used to give a general opinion about everything","c":"整體來說（總結）","s":"The hotel room was small, but it was clean and the staff were friendly. _____, we had a pleasant stay in Hualien."},{"w":"therefore","p":"adv.","d":"used to show a result","c":"因此（結果）","s":"Our family wants to save money for a trip to Japan. _____, we eat at home more often instead of going to restaurants."},{"w":"thus","p":"adv.","d":"used to show a result","c":"因此；所以（結果）（正式用語）","s":"Kevin practiced the piano for two hours every day. _____, he played beautifully at the school concert."}]},{"unit":6,"theme":"to conclude – thereafter","cards":[{"w":"to conclude","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to start the last part or main idea","c":"總結來說；最後（結論）","s":"Cell phones are useful, but they can also hurt our eyes and sleep. _____ _____, we should use them carefully and not too often."},{"w":"to sum up","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give a short review of the main points","c":"總而言之（總結）","s":"We need more trash cans, more trees, and less noise in our park. _____ _____ _____, we want a cleaner and quieter park for everyone."},{"w":"to summarize","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give a short review of the main points","c":"總結（總結）","s":"Dogs are friendly, smart, and good at protecting the house. _____ _____, they make great pets for many families."},{"w":"ultimately","p":"adv.","d":"used to show the final result after a long time","c":"最終；最後（總結／結果）","s":"The students talked about many places for the class trip for a week. _____, they decided to visit the science museum in Taichung."},{"w":"after + 子句","p":"conj.","d":"used to show that one thing happens later than another","c":"在……之後（時間）","s":"My little brother always brushes his teeth _____ he eats breakfast. Then he puts on his school uniform and leaves home."},{"w":"afterward","p":"adv.","d":"used to show something happens later","c":"之後；後來（時間）","s":"We cleaned the classroom together on Friday afternoon. _____, our teacher gave everyone a small piece of cake."},{"w":"at length","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to say that something happens after a long time","c":"終於；最後（時間）（正式用語）","s":"We waited for the bus in the rain for almost an hour. _____ _____, it arrived, and we all got on quickly."},{"w":"at that/this point","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to talk about one exact moment","c":"就在那時／此時（時間）","s":"The game was tied, and there was only one minute left. _____ _____ _____, Jason kicked the ball into the goal."},{"w":"at that/this time","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to talk about a time in the past or now","c":"當時／這時（時間）","s":"My grandparents moved to Taipei in 1980. _____ _____ _____, there was no MRT, so they took the bus everywhere."},{"w":"at present","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to talk about now","c":"目前；現在（時間）","s":"Our school library is closed for repairs this month. _____ _____, students can borrow books from the classroom reading corner."},{"w":"at the same time","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show two things happen together","c":"同時（時間）","s":"My mom was cooking dinner in the kitchen. _____ _____ _____ _____, my dad was helping my sister with her homework."},{"w":"before + 子句","p":"conj.","d":"used to show that one thing happens earlier than another","c":"在……之前（時間）","s":"Please wash your hands carefully _____ you eat lunch. There are many germs on the desks and door handles."},{"w":"currently","p":"adv.","d":"used to talk about now","c":"目前；現在（時間）","s":"Ms. Wang is a very busy science teacher. _____, she is teaching three classes and helping with the school science fair."},{"w":"during + N","p":"prep.","d":"used to show something happens in a period of time","c":"在……期間（時間）","s":"Many students like to play basketball on the playground _____ the lunch break. Others prefer to read or take a nap."},{"w":"earlier","p":"adv.","d":"used to talk about a time before now","c":"稍早；之前（時間）","s":"I am not hungry for dinner right now. _____, I ate a big bowl of beef noodles with my friends after school."},{"w":"finally","p":"adv.","d":"used to say something happens after a long time","c":"終於；最後（時間）","s":"We walked up the mountain for three long hours. _____, we reached the top and saw the beautiful view."},{"w":"formerly","p":"adv.","d":"used to talk about how something was in the past","c":"以前；從前（時間）（正式用語）","s":"This coffee shop is very popular with students now. _____, it was a small bookstore owned by an old couple."},{"w":"immediately","p":"adv.","d":"used to say something happens right away","c":"立刻；馬上（時間）","s":"The fire alarm rang loudly in the middle of class. _____, all the students walked out of the building in a line."},{"w":"in the future","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to talk about a time after now","c":"將來；未來（時間）","s":"Lisa loves animals and often takes care of stray cats. _____ _____ _____, she hopes to become a vet and help sick pets."},{"w":"in the meantime","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to talk about the time while you wait for something","c":"在這期間；同時（時間）","s":"Dinner will be ready in about twenty minutes. _____ _____ _____, you can set the table and wash your hands."},{"w":"in the past","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to talk about a time before now","c":"過去；以前（時間）","s":"Most people use smartphones to take photos today. _____ _____ _____, people used film cameras and waited days to see their pictures."},{"w":"initially","p":"adv.","d":"used to talk about the situation at the beginning","c":"起初；最初（時間）","s":"_____, only ten students joined the school English club. Now, more than forty students come to the meetings every week."},{"w":"later","p":"adv.","d":"used to talk about a time after now or after something","c":"之後；稍後（時間）","s":"I can't play video games with you right now because I have homework. _____, after I finish it, we can play together."},{"w":"meanwhile","p":"adv.","d":"used to show two things happen at the same time","c":"同時；與此同時（時間）","s":"Dad was washing the car in front of the house. _____, my brother and I were cleaning our bedrooms upstairs."},{"w":"now","p":"adv.","d":"used to talk about the present time","c":"現在（時間）","s":"Ten years ago, my town had only one small convenience store. _____, there are five stores and a big supermarket."},{"w":"presently","p":"adv.","d":"used to say something will happen soon","c":"不久；很快（時間）（正式用語）","s":"The doctor is busy with another patient right now. She will see you _____, so please take a seat and wait."},{"w":"previously","p":"adv.","d":"used to talk about a time before now","c":"先前；以前（時間）","s":"Our school has a new computer room this year. _____, all the classes had to share one small, old computer room."},{"w":"prior to + N/V-ing","p":"prep.phr.","d":"used to mean 'before'","c":"在……之前（時間）（正式用語）","s":"Students must turn off their phones _____ _____ entering the exam room. Phones that ring will cause problems for everyone."},{"w":"recently","p":"adv.","d":"used to talk about something that happened not long ago","c":"最近（時間）","s":"My aunt has been very busy these days. _____, she started a small bakery and sells bread to her neighbors every morning."},{"w":"shortly","p":"adv.","d":"used to say something will happen soon","c":"不久；很快（時間）","s":"The train is a little late this morning. It will arrive _____, so please stand behind the yellow line."},{"w":"simultaneously","p":"adv.","d":"used to show two things happen at exactly the same time","c":"同時（時間）（正式用語）","s":"The two runners ran very fast and crossed the finish line _____. The judges could not decide who won the race."},{"w":"soon","p":"adv.","d":"used to say something will happen in a short time","c":"很快；不久（時間）","s":"It is getting dark, and the clouds are very black. It will _____ start to rain, so let's go home now."},{"w":"subsequently","p":"adv.","d":"used to show something happened after an earlier event","c":"後來；隨後（時間）（正式用語）","s":"Ben hurt his leg badly during basketball practice. He _____ missed three games and had to watch from the bench."},{"w":"then","p":"adv.","d":"used to mean 'at that time in the past'","c":"那時；當時（時間）","s":"My family lived in a small village in Pingtung in 2015. _____, I was only five and didn't know any English at all."},{"w":"thereafter","p":"adv.","d":"used to mean 'after that time'","c":"此後；從那之後（時間）（正式用語）","s":"Grandpa stopped drinking soda when he turned sixty. _____, he felt much healthier and walked in the park every morning."}]},{"unit":7,"theme":"綜合練習 Practice Q1–30","cards":[{"w":"Above all","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show the most important point","c":"最重要的是（強調）","s":""},{"w":"Additionally","p":"adv.","d":"used to add another point","c":"此外（補充）","s":""},{"w":"As an illustration","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give an example that shows an idea","c":"舉例說明（舉例）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"Ultimately","p":"adv.","d":"used to show the final result after a long time","c":"最終；最後（總結／結果）","s":""},{"w":"Indeed","p":"adv.","d":"used to say that something is really true","c":"確實；的確（強調）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"In fact","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to add a stronger, true point","c":"事實上（強調）","s":""},{"w":"followed by","p":"prep.phr.","d":"used to show what comes next in order","c":"接著是；隨後是（時間順序）","s":""},{"w":"markedly","p":"adv.","d":"used to show a big and clear change","c":"明顯地（說明程度）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"To conclude","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to start the last part or main idea","c":"總結來說；最後（結論）","s":""},{"w":"similar to","p":"adj.phr.","d":"used to say one thing is almost the same as another","c":"和……相似（比較）","s":""},{"w":"As a result","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show the result of something","c":"結果；因此（結果）","s":""},{"w":"whereas","p":"conj.","d":"used to compare two different facts","c":"然而；而（對比）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"Immediately","p":"adv.","d":"used to say something happens right away","c":"立刻；馬上（時間）","s":""},{"w":"Alternatively","p":"adv.","d":"used to give another choice","c":"或者；另一個選擇是（替代）","s":""},{"w":"Thereafter","p":"adv.","d":"used to mean 'after that time'","c":"此後；從那之後（時間）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"simultaneously","p":"adv.","d":"used to show two things happen at exactly the same time","c":"同時（時間）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"as well as","p":"conj.phr.","d":"used to add another thing; means 'and also'","c":"以及；還有（補充）","s":""},{"w":"In essence","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give the most basic or main idea","c":"本質上；基本上（總結重點）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"After","p":"conj.","d":"used to show that one thing happens first and the next thing follows","c":"在……之後（時間順序）","s":""},{"w":"Specifically","p":"adv.","d":"used to give more exact details","c":"具體來說（舉例說明）","s":""},{"w":"Consequently","p":"adv.","d":"used to show the result of an action","c":"因此；結果（結果）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"followed by","p":"prep.phr.","d":"used to show what comes next in order","c":"接著是；隨後是（時間順序）","s":""},{"w":"On the whole","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give a general opinion","c":"大體上；整體來說（總結）","s":""},{"w":"Finally","p":"adv.","d":"used to introduce the last step or the end result","c":"最後；終於（順序／結果）","s":""},{"w":"Therefore","p":"adv.","d":"used to show a result or conclusion","c":"因此；所以（結果）","s":""},{"w":"In summary","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give a short review of the main points","c":"總結來說（總結）","s":""},{"w":"Unlike","p":"prep.","d":"used to show that two people or things are different","c":"不像；與……不同（對比）","s":""},{"w":"whereas","p":"conj.","d":"used to compare two different facts","c":"然而；而（對比）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"After all","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give an important reason to remember","c":"畢竟（補充說明）","s":""},{"w":"Hence","p":"adv.","d":"used to show a result, often in writing","c":"因此（結果）（正式用語）","s":""}]},{"unit":8,"theme":"綜合練習 Practice Q31–62","cards":[{"w":"formerly","p":"adv.","d":"used to talk about how something was in the past","c":"以前；從前（時間）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"Thus","p":"adv.","d":"used to show a result, often in writing","c":"因此（結果）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"namely","p":"adv.","d":"used to name the exact people or things","c":"也就是；即（舉例說明）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"at the same time","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to add another side of an idea","c":"同時；但另一方面（補充／延伸）","s":""},{"w":"In the past","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to talk about a time before now","c":"過去；以前（時間）","s":""},{"w":"Previously","p":"adv.","d":"used to talk about something that happened before now","c":"先前；以前（時間）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"during","p":"prep.","d":"used to show something happens in a period of time","c":"在……期間（時間）","s":""},{"w":"another","p":"adj.","d":"used to add one more thing of the same kind","c":"另一個（補充）","s":""},{"w":"prior to","p":"prep.phr.","d":"used to mean 'before'","c":"在……之前（時間）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"In brief","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to say something in a few words","c":"簡言之（總結）","s":""},{"w":"Nonetheless","p":"adv.","d":"used to show that something still happens after a problem","c":"儘管如此（讓步）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"In contrast","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show that two things are very different","c":"相比之下；對照之下（對比）","s":""},{"w":"Moreover","p":"adv.","d":"used to add a stronger or more important point","c":"此外；而且（補充）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"Admittedly","p":"adv.","d":"used to agree that something bad or different is true","c":"不可否認地（讓步）","s":""},{"w":"Even though","p":"conj.phr.","d":"used to show that something happens even with a problem","c":"即使；雖然（讓步）","s":""},{"w":"First","p":"adv.","d":"used to list steps in order","c":"第一／第二／第三（順序）","s":""},{"w":"To summarize","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give a short review of the main points","c":"總結（總結）","s":""},{"w":"In addition","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to add more information","c":"此外；另外（補充）","s":""},{"w":"Instead","p":"adv.","d":"used to show what happens in place of another thing","c":"反而；取而代之（替代）","s":""},{"w":"In other words","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to say the same idea in another way","c":"換句話說（重新說明）","s":""},{"w":"Previously","p":"adv.","d":"used to talk about something that happened before now","c":"先前；以前（時間）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"For this reason","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show the reason for the next action","c":"因為這個原因；因此（原因）","s":""},{"w":"For example","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give an example","c":"例如；舉例來說（舉例）","s":""},{"w":"Previously","p":"adv.","d":"used to talk about something that happened before now","c":"先前；以前（時間）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"Further","p":"adv.","d":"used to add one more point, often in writing","c":"此外；再者（補充）（正式用語）","s":""},{"w":"Finally","p":"adv.","d":"used to introduce the last step or the end result","c":"最後；終於（順序／結果）","s":""},{"w":"In the same way","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to show that two things are similar","c":"同樣地（比較）","s":""},{"w":"Differing from","p":"prep.phr.","d":"used to show how one person or thing is not the same as another","c":"與……不同（對比）","s":""},{"w":"To sum up","p":"adv.phr.","d":"used to give a short review of the main points","c":"總而言之（總結）","s":""},{"w":"Similarly","p":"adv.","d":"used to show that two things are alike","c":"同樣地；相似地（比較）","s":""},{"w":"Equally important","p":"adj.phr.","d":"used to add a point that is just as important as the last one","c":"同樣重要的是（補充）","s":""},{"w":"Then","p":"adv.","d":"used to show the next thing that happens","c":"然後；接著（順序）","s":""}]}];
